24=24 - EG1---> Decay
25=25 - EG1---> Sustain
26=26 - EG1---> Release
27=27 - LFO 1---> Frequency
28=28 - PATCH 1---> Intensity
29=29 - PATCH 2---> Intensity
30=30 - PATCH 3---> Intensity
31=31 - PATCH 4---> Intensity
64=64 - Damper
65=65 - Portamento
70=70 - EG2---> Sustain
71=71 - FILTER---> Resonance
72=72 - EG2---> Release
73=73 - EG2---> Attack
